#: ../../assemblies.rst:4
msgid ""
"Orbit bundles annotation for 18 assemblies across 9 species. Sequence is "
"not bundled — it is streamed from UCSC on demand, which is what keeps the"
" download small."
msgstr "Orbit 内置 9 个物种共 18 个装配的注释。序列不打包——按需从 UCSC 流式读取，这也是下载体积小的原因。"

