#: ../../assemblies.rst:56
msgid ""
"Each assembly carries gene models, cytobands, chromosome sizes and the "
"primary chromosome order used by the overview panel."
msgstr "每个装配都带基因模型、细胞遗传带、染色体长度，以及总览面板使用的主染色体顺序。"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:60
msgid "How sequence is fetched"
msgstr "序列怎么取"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:62
msgid ""
"Every assembly in ``data/catalog.json`` records a ``twoBitURL`` pointing "
"at the UCSC 2bit file. When you navigate, Orbit issues an HTTP Range "
"request for just the bytes covering the window and decodes them locally."
msgstr ""
"``data/catalog.json`` 里每个装配都记录了一个指向 UCSC 2bit 文件的 ``twoBitURL``。导航时 Orbit"
" 只对窗口覆盖的字节发 HTTP Range 请求，在本地解码。"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:66
msgid "First visit to a chromosome: about one second"
msgstr "首次访问某条染色体：约 1 秒"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:67
msgid "Subsequent moves within it: about 0.3 seconds"
msgstr "之后在其上移动：约 0.3 秒"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:68
msgid "Nothing is written to disk; the range cache is in memory and per session"
msgstr "不写磁盘；Range 缓存在内存里，随会话结束而消失"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:70
msgid ""
"If the network is unavailable, the sequence and GC tracks go grey and "
"everything else keeps working."
msgstr "网络不可用时，序列和 GC 轨道变灰，其余功能照常。"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:74
msgid "Offline mode"
msgstr "离线模式"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:76
msgid ""
"Set ``ORBIT_OFFLINE=1`` before launching to forbid network access. "
"Combined with a local FASTA or 2bit, this gives a fully air-gapped "
"browser::"
msgstr "启动前设置 ``ORBIT_OFFLINE=1`` 即可禁止联网。配合本地 FASTA 或 2bit，就是一个完全隔离的浏览器："

#: ../../assemblies.rst:82
msgid ""
"With no local sequence the GC and sequence tracks stay disabled, but "
"genes, cytobands, search and imported tracks are unaffected."
msgstr "没有本地序列时，GC 和序列轨道保持禁用，但基因、细胞遗传带、搜索和导入的轨道不受影响。"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:86
msgid "Adding your own assembly"
msgstr "添加自己的装配"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:88
msgid "Edit ``data/catalog.json`` and add an entry alongside the existing ones:"
msgstr "编辑 ``data/catalog.json``，在现有条目旁边加一条："

#: ../../assemblies.rst:102
msgid ""
"Then place ``genes.igvbin`` and ``cytoband.json`` under "
"``data/ann/myAssembly/``. The binary index is produced by the build "
"scripts in ``build/``; see :doc:`how-it-works` for the format."
msgstr ""
"然后把 ``genes.igvbin`` 和 ``cytoband.json`` 放到 ``data/ann/myAssembly/`` "
"下。二进制索引由 ``build/`` 里的构建脚本生成；格式见 :doc:`how-it-works`。"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:106
msgid ""
"Restart Orbit and the assembly appears in the selector. Nothing else "
"needs to change — the frontend reads the catalog, not a hard-coded list."
msgstr "重启 Orbit，装配就会出现在选择器里。其它都不用改——前端读的是 catalog，不是硬编码列表。"

msgid "Frontend export"
msgstr "前端导出"

msgid "``composePlot`` / ``composeVector`` generate the downloadable files"
msgstr "``composePlot`` / ``composeVector`` 生成可下载的导出文件"

msgid "Bundled newer build"
msgstr "内置较新版本"

msgid "Bundled older build"
msgstr "内置较旧版本"

msgid "UCSC ncbiRefSeq / sgdGene"
msgstr "UCSC ncbiRefSeq / sgdGene"

msgid "Response time depends on the network and reference index."
msgstr "响应时间取决于网络状况和参考索引。"

msgid ""
"The range cache is in memory and per session, not a persistent offline "
"genome."
msgstr "区间缓存位于内存中，仅在本次会话有效，不是持久保存的离线基因组。"

msgid "Local 2bit takes priority over the remote source."
msgstr "本地 2bit 优先于远程序列源。"

msgid ""
"For a second instance, use a different port. To isolate imported data "
"too, prepare a separate compatible data folder and pass it with "
"``--data``:"
msgstr "第二个实例应使用不同端口。如需同时隔离导入数据，请准备独立且结构兼容的数据目录，并通过 ``--data`` 指定："

msgid ""
"Changing the port alone does not isolate data. Do not rely on an "
"unsupported ``ORBIT_HOME`` setting to separate research files."
msgstr "只更换端口不会隔离数据。不要依赖未支持的 ``ORBIT_HOME`` 设置来隔离科研文件。"

msgid ""
"User data may remain in ``%LOCALAPPDATA%/Orbit`` or the application data "
"folder. Back up imported research files before uninstalling. Do not "
"delete an entire user-data folder merely to reset colours or another "
"display preference."
msgstr ""
"用户数据可能仍保存在 ``%LOCALAPPDATA%/Orbit`` "
"或应用数据目录中。卸载前请备份导入的科研文件，不要仅为了重置颜色等显示偏好而删除整个用户数据目录。"

msgid ""
"The backend uses the standard library ThreadingHTTPServer, bound to "
"localhost by default. It serves the frontend and JSON APIs; the frontend "
"composes exports."
msgstr "后端采用标准库 ThreadingHTTPServer，默认绑定本机地址。它提供前端页面与 JSON API；导出由前端合成。"

msgid ""
"Set ``ORBIT_OFFLINE=1`` before launching to disable remote 2bit fallback."
" A local matching 2bit supplies built-in reference operations offline. "
"Imported FASTA remains an independent sequence track; see "
":doc:`sequence`::"
msgstr ""
"启动前设置 ``ORBIT_OFFLINE=1`` 可禁用远程 2bit 回退。匹配的本地 2bit 支持内置参考序列操作离线工作。导入 "
"FASTA 仍是独立序列轨道；详见 :doc:`sequence` 。"

msgid "Assembly selector listing human and model-organism reference builds"
msgstr "装配选择菜单，列出人类与模式物种的参考版本"

msgid ""
"Choose the reference build before searching or importing. The bundled "
"annotation list is not a claim that these are the newest available "
"assemblies."
msgstr "搜索或导入前先选择参考装配。内置注释列表并不表示这些是目前可获得的最新装配版本。"

